compute pooling is impossible, application-level distributed workflows (Thunderbolt Bridge IP networking at 15–35 Gbps, distributed LLM tensor slicing via Exo/llama.cpp RPC, Logic Pro nodes, and Compressor render clusters) are fully viable."}
